#!/bin/sh
# Minimum human proposal surface. Separate from the Jarvis service/timer:
# this is a human-run command, not gated by JARVIS_ENABLED, so a proposal
# can be inspected/approved/rejected even while the automated loop is off.
set -eu
[ "$(id -u)" -eq 0 ] || { echo "root required" >&2; exit 1; }
# Istege bagli kutuphaneler (zeyrek morfolojisi, trafilatura tarih cikarimi)
# venv'de kurulu. Sistem python'u onlari goremez ve servis sessizce daha az
# yetenekli calisir -- jarvis-web venv kullandigi icin panel ile dongu
# farkli davraniyordu. venv yoksa python3'e dusulur.
JARVIS_PY=/opt/lcarlie/jarvis-phase2/venv/bin/python
[ -x "$JARVIS_PY" ] || JARVIS_PY=python3

cd /opt/lcarlie/jarvis-phase2
exec "$JARVIS_PY" -m jarvis.operator_cli "$@"
